THIS IS AN EXISTENCE PROOF, NOT A POSITION NUMBER. READ THE CAVEATS.

What it shows: `photo p2 inter` — the cell
`benchmarks/perf_2026-09-05-arm10-POSITION.meta` reports as **25/25 ERR with no
timing at all** — now produces a timing. That ERR was the global-motion
refusal (`svt_aom_derive_gm_level` is non-zero for every inter frame at preset
<= 4), and `docs/INTER-ENCODE-PLAN.md` §1z⁴¹/§1z⁴² lifted it. Three rounds, zero
ERR lines.

